    "detailed_description": "&quot;\u8cb4\u65b9\u304c\u72fc\u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u30c7\u30b9\uff01&quot; is a short death game that revolves around the theme of werewolves.<br>Your role in this game is to listen to the discussions of the four characters engaged in the werewolf death game and identify the owner of the werewolf card.<br><br>By repeating the death game, which lasts approximately 5 minutes per round, you can gradually acquire &quot;specifications.&quot;<br>Collecting and viewing these &quot;specifications&quot; will reveal the full details of this death game.<br><br>Four men and women find themselves trapped in an unfamiliar sealed room.<br>The fate awaiting them, including <strong>&quot;YOU,&quot;</strong> is...?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2>...uuum.....<br><br>As I tried to roll over, I realized that the place I was sleeping in was not suitable for &quot;sleeping.&quot;<br><br>&quot;W-Where is this place...?&quot;<br><br>It was a dimly lit room, resembling a warehouse. Four unfamiliar men and women were trapped in that room.<br><br>A &quot;girl&quot; displayed on the monitor mocks them.<br>And she forces them to participate in a certain &quot;card game.&quot;<br><br><strong>&quot;It's the beginning of a life-or-death werewolf game, where losers face death!&quot;</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;\u8cb4\u65b9\u304c\u72fc\u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u30c7\u30b9\uff01&quot; is a short death game that revolves around the theme of werewolves.<br>Your role in this game is to listen to the discussions of the four characters engaged in the werewolf death game and identify the owner of the werewolf card.<br><br>By repeating the death game, which lasts approximately 5 minutes per round, you can gradually acquire &quot;specifications.&quot;<br>Collecting and viewing these &quot;specifications&quot; will reveal the full details of this death game.<br><br>Four men and women find themselves trapped in an unfamiliar sealed room.<br>The fate awaiting them, including <strong>&quot;YOU,&quot;</strong> is...?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2>...uuum.....<br><br>As I tried to roll over, I realized that the place I was sleeping in was not suitable for &quot;sleeping.&quot;<br><br>&quot;W-Where is this place...?&quot;<br><br>It was a dimly lit room, resembling a warehouse. Four unfamiliar men and women were trapped in that room.<br><br>A &quot;girl&quot; displayed on the monitor mocks them.<br>And she forces them to participate in a certain &quot;card game.&quot;<br><br><strong>&quot;It's the beginning of a life-or-death werewolf game, where losers face death!&quot;</strong>",
